"}, "body": "「守矢神社の裏で飯綱丸が早苗に壁ドンしている」　をリクエストします。\n\n可能でしたら以前描かれた「イケメン記者に壁ドンされる巫女」の逆向きの構図でお願いしたいです。\n\nシチュエーションは守矢が気に入らない飯綱丸は憂さ晴らしに早苗さんを口説いて落としてやろうとしている\n\n状況は飯綱丸が早苗の右側に壁ドン、左手で早苗の右手を掴みつつ早苗に顔を近づけている\n早苗の左手は少し握りつつ胸の真ん中に当ててる\n\n早苗はいきなり飯綱丸に詰め寄られた為赤面になって動揺を隠せない表情\n飯綱丸は不敵な笑みを浮かべている。　飯綱丸の表情は極力イケメンに描いていただけると嬉しいです\n\nどうかよろしくお願い致します。", "nc": 129, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}], "sent_works": [], "similar_creators": [{"id": 96, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": true, "name": "あとき", "screen_name": "atoki", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1477587085330886661/X30L2Sq7.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/52319364/1622985116/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "complete_expiration_days": 120, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}, {"genre": "comic"}, {"genre": "correction"}], "nc": 33}, {"id": 2748, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": false, "name": "砂", "screen_name": "s73d", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1695650088289529856/umhYLgY_.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/24903901/1753271898/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "complete_expiration_days": 60, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}, {"genre": "correction"}], "nc": 144}, {"id": 28275, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": true, "name": "Kayo", "screen_name": "kayonpeke", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1787650572763738113/FtTsCaj0.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/997807728625049600/1756251423/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "reques